# rediseno-proyectos u18 (F4): an area filter that hides every active project keeps the menu button (the way
# back to the filter) and offers a button to clear it. Home has no active project in the seed (Huerto is
# archived). The walk clears the filter at the end, so it can run again.
# Needs the seed: python .claude/scripts/seed_progress_db.py --device
# Run: python bbadb.py run-steps .claude/skills/adb-ui-test/steps/rp-area-filter.steps --save rp-area-filter
GRANT android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
START .configuration.SplashActivity
WAIT 5000
TAP id=navigation_projects
WAIT 2500
ASSERT id=projectsSelector
TAP id=projectsMenuButton
WAIT 800
TAP text=Filter by area|Filtrar por área
WAIT 800
TAP text=Home|Casa
WAIT 1200
ASSERT id=projectsMenuButton
ASSERT id=projectsFilterState
SHOT rp-area-filter-hides-all
TAP id=projectsClearFilter
WAIT 1200
ASSERT id=projectsSelector
SHOT rp-area-filter-cleared
